  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the tagliatelle pasta according to package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat and saute the garlic until fragrant.",
    "Add the kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, and sun-dried tomatoes to the skillet and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the crumbled feta cheese and cook until melted and gooey.",
    "Add the cooked tagliatelle pasta to the skillet and toss to combine with the cheese and vegetable mixture.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and grated lemon zest.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "For an extra crispy topping, deep-fry some additional tagliatelle pasta in hot oil until golden brown and sprinkle on top."
